# Build artifacts.
# No trailing slash: a pattern ending in `/` matches directories only, so a
# *symlink* with the same name slips past it silently (this happened to
# `/models` below — a symlink named `models` got committed and a merge then
# destroyed the real tree it was shadowing). Every pattern in this file
# that names something this repo's own scripts create is anchored and
# slash-free so it matches the entry whatever its type.
target

# Packaged app (VUHO_BUNDLE_MODEL=1 embeds the ~474 MB model —
# scripts/bundle-macos.sh recreates this directory on every run, making it
# the highest-risk entry for the symlink hole described above)
/Vuho.app
/dist

# ML models (provisioned out-of-band via scripts/fetch-model.sh).
/models

# Local agent/tooling state. `.rune` is a mode-700 SQLite database of local
# session state and `.claude` holds a machine-specific permission allowlist —
# neither belongs in a public repo. Both previously survived only because each
# directory carried its own `*` ignore file, which is itself ignored and so
# vanishes with any tree clean; anchor them here where the repo can see them.
/.claude
/.rune
/.venv

# IDE
*.swiftpm
.xcuserdata

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
